        <mxCell id="tck_notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Key Architecture Decisions:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#10;• &lt;b&gt;SLA Snapshot:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;sla_duration_minutes&lt;/code&gt; dan &lt;code&gt;sla_deadline&lt;/code&gt; disimpan langsung pada ticket.&lt;br&gt;&#10;• &lt;b&gt;Double User Relation:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;reporter_id&lt;/code&gt; (NOT NULL) dan &lt;code&gt;technician_id&lt;/code&gt; (NULLABLE) merujuk ke tabel users.&lt;br&gt;&#10;• &lt;b&gt;Cascade Delete on Sub-entities:&lt;/b&gt; Comment, attachment metadata, dan history terhapus otomatis saat ticket di-purge fisik." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8f9fa;strokeColor=#b1b1b1;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
